# Ignore file for apps/soc/Dockerfile only. BuildKit (the default builder in
# current Docker and Compose) reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the
# context-root .dockerignore; the build context is the repository root
# (docker-compose.yml), as for apps/checkout/Dockerfile.
#
# Allowlist: the image needs apps/soc and nothing else, which also keeps data/
# (recorded real sessions) and .env out of the context. The host's
# node_modules must not be laid over the tree `npm ci` installs in the image (a
# Windows host's packages in a Linux image), and a local dist/ must not stand
# in for the build.
*
!apps/soc

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
